  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Basic Health Care Services for Internally Displaced Persons, Returnees and Host Communities.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to contribute towards peaceful coexistence and an inclusive environment by encouraging the return and resettlement of IDPs through ensuring access to quality healthcare services. To achieve this, IOM will undertake the reconstruction and rehabilitation of health facilities, provide necessary equipment for health facilities, build capacity for healthcare workers, and strengthen community administrative capacity in health service delivery.</narrative>
  </description>
